# Build output
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
/artifacts/
*.user
*.suo

# NOTE: /artifacts/ is anchored to the repo root on purpose — it is the .NET build
# output directory. An unanchored `artifacts/` would also swallow docs/artifacts/,
# which is the archived-plan index and must be tracked.

# NOTE: Supervisor/wwwroot is COMMITTED build output (the .NET build only copies it).
# Do not ignore it — a stale bundle ships silently otherwise.

# Node
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
.vite/

# Skill deploy targets — reproducible output of `supervisor skills install`,
# never edited by hand. Source of truth is skills/.
.claude/skills/
.github/skills/
.agents/skills/

# Playwright
/e2e/test-results/
/e2e/playwright-report/
/e2e/.cache/

# Editors / OS
.vs/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Local settings that should not travel
.claude/settings.local.json
